      "body": "Closes #41230.\n\nAdds a subsection to the NixlConnector usage guide explaining how\nNixlKVConnectorStats.aggregate()/.reduce() (used for the periodic CLI\nlog line) and NixlPromMetrics (used for the /metrics endpoint) compute\ntheir numbers independently from the same raw transfer data — so CLI and\nPrometheus percentiles/averages for the same window aren't expected to\nmatch exactly. Also documents the failure-only-interval edge case in\nis_empty().\n\nDocs-only change, no code touched.\n\nThis PR description and doc wording were drafted with AI assistance\n(Claude) and reviewed by the submitter before opening.",
